<title>NORWAY: Fokus to announce Q1 results on April 15.</title>
<headline>Fokus to announce Q1 results on April 15.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Fokus Bank has moved forward the date for its first-quarter result announcement to Tuesday, April 15, from April 25, an Oslo Bourse statement said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the results would be presented early &quot;because of the existing situation&quot;.</p>
<p>Sixteen savings banks made a hostile takeover bid on Monday for Fokus, Norway's fourth largest bank.</p>
<p>-- Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
